#####
##### extension-prometheus (local Compose) — env reference
#####
# The sidecar container loads three local env files (in order):
#
#   infra/config/local/extensions.env              — app toggles + OTLP endpoint (also used by apps)
#   infra/config/local/extension-sidecar-otel.env — OTLP receiver + sidecar trace forwarding
#   infra/config/local/extension-prometheus.env    — Prometheus scrape / sidecar metrics
#
# Seeded by make local_env_setup from infra/config/env-templates/*.env.example.
#
# Canonical templates:
#   extensions.env.example
#   extension-sidecar-otel.env.example
#   extension-prometheus.env.example
#
# Package references:
#   extensions/sidecar-otel.env.example
#   extensions/prometheus/.env.example
